{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちはっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"松村沙友理です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブにむけて着々と進んでおります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"西武ドームめっちゃ寒いらしいですね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ寒いけど\nドームですよ。\nドーム。\n凄いなぁ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広いんだろな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんな景色なんやろな～。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく楽しみです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けど、やっぱり防寒は完璧に！\n寒過ぎて集中出来ない！とか駄目ですよ(´•̥ ω •̥` )\n大袈裟かな(´･_･｀)って位の防寒で！！\nけど、温度調節できるような格好で！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ、楽しみましょう。\nスカパー！を観てくださる方も\n一緒に楽しみましょう！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、２月２２日は２２時から\nWOWOWの連続ドラマW\n「天使のナイフ」もよろしくお願いします！\nＢＳが観れる方は第一話が観れるらしいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.matsumura/img/blog/sayuri.matsumura/img/2015/02/20/4211464/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新制服～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポニーテールにはまってます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみんまりちゃはぴばっ(´ｰ`* ))))\nべりーきゅーとらぶっ♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブ頑張ります♡♡\nうちわとタオル見つめるぞーσ(o･ω･o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.matsumura/img/blog/sayuri.matsumura/img/2015/02/20/4211464/0001.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}